    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Each restricted stock unit represents the right to receive, at settlement, on share of common stock. This transaction represents the settlement of 810 RSUs that were granted 3/2/26 as partial compensation for services on a pro rata basis as Chair of the Board during the 2025-26 annual meeting cycle. The units vested September 25, 2026 and were settled 11/6/26.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">Each restricted stock unit represents the right to receive, at settlement, one share of common stock.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">These transactions represents the grant of 25,848 restricted stock units as part of the director's base compensation for the 2026-2027 Annual Meeting cycle and the grant of 7,755 units a part of a stipend awarded to the Chairman of the Board for his service as such during the 2026-2027 Annual Meeting cycle. The restricted stock units were granted on November 7, 2026, vest, conditioned on service to the vesting date, on the earlier of the one year anniversary of grant or the 2027 Annual Meeting of Shareholders, provided it is held no less than 50 weeks after the 2026 Annual Meeting of Shareholders, and are required to be settled by March 15 of the year following vesting.</footnote>
